[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8342.07, "timestamp": "02:19:02", "text": "切換所有法術。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8345.27, "timestamp": "02:19:05", "text": "你還需要準備你的法術。我這就來一步步教你。所以，如果你打開角色卡上的法術標籤頁，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8347.11, "timestamp": "02:19:07", "text": "例如旁邊寫著“書”的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8361.83, "timestamp": "02:19:21", "text": "那個選項，當你把滑鼠懸停在上面時，應該會顯示“法術”，你可以在"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8370.193, "timestamp": "02:19:30", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "there was a link thereUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/7cIfY5niDOmSkNAP08CA6A4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8371.19, "timestamp": "02:19:31", "text": "那裡應用法術，也可以在那裡準備你的法術。  你可以在每次休息時更改它。所以，嗯，不用太擔心準備的問題。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8375.349, "timestamp": "02:19:35", "text": "你可以準備其中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8376.469, "timestamp": "02:19:36", "text": "九個。請隨意選擇，我會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8381.27, "timestamp": "02:19:41", "text": "檢查你是否明白。第二級、第二級、第三級是？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8391.99, "timestamp": "02:19:51", "text": "哦，好的。所以，嗯，法術等級就是，你擁有與等級相對應的法術位。所以你會看到第一層，然後是側面，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8396.572, "timestamp": "02:19:56", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "eloo ninja"}]